<title>FRANCE: Sommer Allibert H1 net profit falls.</title>
<headline>Sommer Allibert H1 net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sis months to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			   141.9  vs	   203.2</p>
<p>    Pre-tax, pre-exceptional		 331.8  vs	     399</p>
<p>    Cashflow				     612.4  vs	     616</p>
<p>    Investments				    603  vs	     543</p>
<p>Turnover 7,132 vs 6,780</p>
<p>NOTE - Sommer Allibert published its results in a newspaper advertisement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
